  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Tantric Metabolization</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ea/Bo_Dennis_2.gif/revision/latest?cb=20160817233951\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Bo Dennis 2\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ea/Bo_Dennis_2.gif/revision/latest?cb=20160817233951\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ea/Bo_Dennis_2.gif/revision/latest?cb=20160817233951 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/ea/Bo_Dennis_2.gif/revision/latest?cb=20160817233951 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Bo Dennis 2\" width=\"245\" height=\"125\" data-image-key=\"Bo_Dennis_2.gif\" data-image-name=\"Bo Dennis 2.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Bo Dennis (Lost Girl) demonstrates her need to feed.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Feed off of sexual energy.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"Humankind has long tried to tame the forces of nature, to harness their power for our needs. But what if the very needs that drive us are the greatest power of all? Will we be able to control ourselves?\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Caught In The Act Opening Words (The Outer Limits)</dd></dl></div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"Wait. It feeds by having sex? Oh, man, I wish I could do that.\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Wendy envying The Mandragora (Witches of East End)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The power to <b>feed off sexuality/sexual energy</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Tantric_Manipulation\" title=\"Tantric Manipulation\">Tantric Manipulation</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Indomitable_Sexuality\" title=\"Indomitable Sexuality\">Indomitable Sexuality</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Psi_Vampirism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Psi Vampirism\">Psi Vampirism</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Sex_Empowerment\" title=\"Sex Empowerment\">Sex Empowerment</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Metabolization\" title=\"Energy Metabolization\">Energy Metabolization</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTantric_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Sexuality/Sexual Energy Metabolization</li>\n<li>Sexual Hunger</li>\n<li>Sexual/Tantric Vampirism</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTantric_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Users can sustain themselves/their powers by feeding off of <a href=\"/wiki/Indomitable_Sexuality\" title=\"Indomitable Sexuality\">sexuality</a> and/or sexual energy from sexuality, sexual experiences, sexual emotions, etc., taking them into their body as a source for their powers and/or conditions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTantric_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Death_By_Sex\" title=\"Death By Sex\">Death By Sex</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">Life-Force Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Absorption\" title=\"Emotion Absorption\">Emotion Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotional_Vampirism\" title=\"Emotional Vampirism\">Emotional Vampirism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Absorption\" title=\"Soul Absorption\">Soul Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Incubus_Physiology\" title=\"Incubus Physiology\">Incubus Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Indomitable_Sexuality\" title=\"Indomitable Sexuality\">Indomitable Sexuality</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lust_Empowerment\" title=\"Lust Empowerment\">Lust Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Perversion_Empowerment\" title=\"Perversion Empowerment\">Perversion Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Psi_Vampirism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Psi Vampirism\">Psi Vampirism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sex_Appeal_Combat\" title=\"Sex Appeal Combat\">Sex Appeal Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sex_Empowerment\" title=\"Sex Empowerment\">Sex Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sex_Healing\" title=\"Sex Healing\">Sex Healing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Succubus_Physiology\" title=\"Succubus Physiology\">Succubus Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vampire_Physiology\" title=\"Vampire Physiology\">Vampire Physiology</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTantric_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May die if prevented from feeding for an extended period of time.</li>\n<li>User of <a href=\"/wiki/Stamina/Absolute\" title=\"Stamina/Absolute\">Limitless Energy</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Life-Force/Absolute\" title=\"Enhanced Life-Force/Absolute\">Absolute Life-Force</a> are completely unaffected.</li>\n<li>May cause sexual addiction.</li>\n<li>May need some kind sexual act.\n<ul><li>Ex. Kissing to actual intercourse.</li></ul></li>\n<li>May not be able to feed off themselves only others.</li>\n<li>May not be able to have sex with someone without feeding off them.</li>\n<li>May cause <a href=\"/wiki/Death_By_Sex\" title=\"Death By Sex\">death by sex</a> towards victims.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTantric_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://anitablake.fandom.com/wiki/Belle_Morte\">Belle Morte</a> (<i>Anita Blake Series</i>)\n<ul><li>Anita Blake</li>\n<li>Jean-Claude</li>\n<li>Richard Zeeman</li></ul></li>\n<li>Succubus (<i>Lost Girl</i>)\n<ul><li>Bo</li>\n<li>Aife</li></ul></li>\n<li>Incubi&#160;(<i>Folklore/Demonology/Mythology</i>)</li>\n<li>Succubi (<i>Folklore/Demonology/Mythology</i>)\n<ul><li>Lilith (<i>Abrahamic Religions</i>)</li></ul></li>\n<li>Monster Girls (<i>Monster Girl Encyclopedia</i>)</li>\n<li>Succubi (<i>Valkyrie Crusade</i>)</li>\n<li>The Mandragora (<i>Witches of East End</i>)</li>\n<li>Sex Gas (<i>Torchwood</i>)</li>\n<li>Anita Blake (<i>Anita Blake: Vampire Hunter</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTantric_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=